  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ELAS+ Brazilian Women&apos;s Fund (Fondo Angela Borba de Recursos para Mulheres) is the first and only women&apos;s fund in Brazil that invests exclusively in promoting the empowerment of women and LBT+ people, providing support to groups of black and indigenous women, LBT+ people, quilombolas, sex workers, women with disabilities, youth, women living in peripheries and favelas, feminist activists, domestic workers, and others. ELAS+ understands that investing in groups led by women and LBT+ is the most effective way to positively develop their society.</narrative>
